          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Uyakuliqhekeza ngamaphiko akhe, angalidabuli libe yizicucu; umpristi awuthungele e-altare phezu kwezinkuni ezisemlilweni; kungumnikelo wokushiswa, umnikelo womlilo, iphunga elimnandi kuJehova.",
          "type": "text",
